@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram

[*] --> ChooseAmount

state "Choose Amount" as ChooseAmount
ChooseAmount : entry / Action needed
ChooseAmount : do / select predefined amount or custom amount
ChooseAmount : exit / selected amount displayed

ChooseAmount --> InputCustomAmount : [user selects custom amount]
ChooseAmount --> CancelTransaction : [user cancels transaction]

state "Input Custom Amount" as InputCustomAmount
InputCustomAmount : entry / user inputs custom amount
InputCustomAmount : do / validate input amount
InputCustomAmount : exit / custom amount accepted

InputCustomAmount --> ChooseAmount

state "Cancel Transaction" as CancelTransaction
CancelTransaction : entry / transaction cancelled
CancelTransaction : do / stop transaction and return card
CancelTransaction : exit / transaction cancelled

CancelTransaction --> [*]

@enduml
